Implement the glPushAttrib/glPopAttrib state groups gl4es left as TODOs,
for the state gl-repl actually exercises: GL_POLYGON_BIT, plus the
line-stipple, point-parameter, and clip-plane-equation gaps in
GL_LINE_BIT / GL_POINT_BIT / GL_TRANSFORM_BIT.

gl-repl brackets every render pass with
glPushAttrib(GL_ALL_ATTRIB_BITS)/glPopAttrib and relies on the pop to
restore defaults, so any group the emulated stack skips leaks scene
state into the GLES context permanently. Each piece here fixes an
observed or same-class leak:

- GL_POLYGON_BIT (was entirely TODO): front-face winding, cull-face
  mode, polygon mode (gl4es stores GL_FILL as 0), and the group's
  cull-face / polygon-offset-fill enables (fields shared with
  GL_ENABLE_BIT, as the stack already shares depth_test et al.). One
  frame of an example calling glFrontFace(GL_CW) used to reverse
  front/back for every scene after it. Polygon smooth/stipple enables
  and the offset factor/units stay TODO -- gl4es does not shadow them,
  and querying the driver here would put a synchronous GLES round-trip
  on a per-frame path.
- GL_LINE_BIT ("TODO: stipple stuff here"): the glLineStipple factor/
  pattern (shadowed in glstate->linestipple) plus the stipple enable.
  The restore is guarded on an actual change because a redundant
  gl4es_glLineStipple would (re)create its emulation texture.
- GL_POINT_BIT: point size min/max, fade threshold, and
  GL_POINT_DISTANCE_ATTENUATION (shadowed in glstate->pointsprite);
  restored through gl4es_glPointParameterf/-fv, which dedup.
- GL_TRANSFORM_BIT: the clip-plane *equations* (the enables already
  round-tripped; the stack's clip_planes field existed but was never
  filled). glClipPlane stores eye-space equations, so the restore
  memcpys glstate->planes[] directly -- calling gl4es_glClipPlanef
  would wrongly re-transform by the modelview current at pop time.

The gl-repl integration regressions (Emscripten build): cycling the
examples past a glFrontFace(GL_CW) scene must not swap two-sided
colors or the winding view on scenes visited afterwards; a scene's
glLineStipple pattern, glPointParameterfv attenuation, or glClipPlane
equation must not carry into a later scene that enables the matching
cap without setting its own values.

Applied by scripts/web-deps.sh after cloning the pinned gl4es checkout.
